  "description": "Concrete dotnet SDK bodies for the Tamp.Components target shapes (ADR 0020): IDotNetRestore / IDotNetCompile / IDotNetTest / IDotNetPack provide the Restore/Compile/Test/Pack CommandPlans via the .NET 10 `dotnet` CLI (Tamp.NetCli.V10), bundling current best practice (no-restore/no-build chaining, --blame-crash on test). Compose a standard build with `class Build : TampBuild, IDotNetTest, IDotNetPack` and satisfy the IHaz* contracts.",
